- Real Apex favicon (svg, ico, apple-touch) replaces the Vite default
- Build step writes per-page title, description, canonical, Open Graph and
  Twitter tags, robots.txt, sitemap.xml and LocalBusiness data
- WhatsApp, Instagram and TikTok filled in, floating WhatsApp button added
- Telegram alert on new enquiries, test button and backup export in dashboard
- Privacy and Terms pages, consent note on the contact form
- Removed unused placeholder Contact component

